1
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:06,731
The Snow-Capped Present

2
00:00:07,605 --> 00:00:08,902
No way! I refuse!

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:13,707
Whenever we do homework together, you just copy my answers.

4
00:00:13,744 --> 00:00:16,805
You'd better do it by yourself for once!

5
00:00:16,848 --> 00:00:19,340
Shizuka.

6
00:00:20,384 --> 00:00:25,015
Shizuka-<i>chan</i> is very cold to me from few days.

7
00:00:25,056 --> 00:00:26,649
Now I'm so worried...

8
00:00:26,691 --> 00:00:28,056
About what?

9
00:00:28,893 --> 00:00:30,088
Doraemon

10
00:00:30,127 --> 00:00:34,189
I'll get married with Shizuka in the future, right?

11
00:00:34,232 --> 00:00:36,098
Yeah, maybe.

12
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:38,101
Maybe? What do you mean?

13
00:00:38,135 --> 00:00:41,901
I mean if there isn't any accident take place.

14
00:00:41,939 --> 00:00:43,270
How can it be?

15
00:00:43,307 --> 00:00:47,107
We're in a tight spot now.

16
00:00:48,346 --> 00:00:52,112
I always wondered

17
00:00:52,149 --> 00:00:57,246
How can Shizuka fall in love with Nobita?

18
00:00:57,288 --> 00:01:00,690
There are so many better boys out there!

19
00:01:00,725 --> 00:01:01,556
Right?

20
00:01:01,592 --> 00:01:02,855
Watch what you speak!

21
00:01:02,894 --> 00:01:04,726
Sorry...

22
00:01:04,762 --> 00:01:06,355
Fine..

23
00:01:06,397 --> 00:01:08,866
Time TV.

24
00:01:10,434 --> 00:01:16,339
14 years from now, on October 25th, you get engaged.

25
00:01:16,374 --> 00:01:19,810
So let's look few days earlier...

26
00:01:19,844 --> 00:01:21,869
This is the future you.

27
00:01:24,815 --> 00:01:27,216
I'm so clumsy.

28
00:01:27,251 --> 00:01:28,741
That's Shizuka.

29
00:01:28,786 --> 00:01:30,276
Make up your mind!

30
00:01:30,321 --> 00:01:34,790
Are you coming with me or not?

31
00:01:34,825 --> 00:01:36,691
Well, I'd love to.

32
00:01:36,727 --> 00:01:38,627
But I hate climbing

33
00:01:38,663 --> 00:01:41,724
If the hill was flat...

34
00:01:41,766 --> 00:01:44,895
You need to grow up.

35
00:01:45,569 --> 00:01:47,059
Forget it.

36
00:01:47,104 --> 00:01:49,402
I'll ask others to go with me.

37
00:01:50,441 --> 00:01:53,342
I don't wanna watch it any more. Take up the speed.

38
00:01:54,912 --> 00:01:56,573
Yi?

39
00:01:56,614 --> 00:01:59,675
Shizuka was alone...

40
00:01:59,717 --> 00:02:02,379
She walks apart from her partners due to the blizzard.

41
00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:05,913
What is Nobita doing now?

42
00:02:06,724 --> 00:02:09,421
He's got a fever.

43
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:12,486
Jeez.

44
00:02:12,530 --> 00:02:15,295
Wait, yeah.

45
00:02:15,333 --> 00:02:16,698
I see.

46
00:02:16,734 --> 00:02:19,066
Machine Cat, lent me your Time Package.

47
00:02:19,103 --> 00:02:20,571
Sure.

48
00:02:22,206 --> 00:02:23,640
What do you want to do?

49
00:02:23,674 --> 00:02:25,199
Don't ask me. You'll know the answer. Keep watching.

50
00:02:28,846 --> 00:02:30,245
You became 14 years older.

51
00:02:30,281 --> 00:02:32,113
And then...

52
00:02:32,149 --> 00:02:34,982
I'm going to rescue Shizuka by the Time Machine.

53
00:02:35,019 --> 00:02:37,283
Well, Shizuka will be deeply affected by me.

54
00:02:37,321 --> 00:02:39,221
You're brave, Nobita.

55
00:02:39,256 --> 00:02:42,590
I'll save you at all costs.

56
00:02:42,626 --> 00:02:44,185
Shizuka, I'm so happy.

57
00:02:44,228 --> 00:02:48,995
Because of this, she'll marry me with pleasure.

58
00:02:50,668 --> 00:02:53,797
Look, don't involve into this case to help me.

59
00:02:53,838 --> 00:02:55,966
I intend to do that by myself.

60
00:02:56,007 --> 00:02:57,031
See you.

61
00:03:01,412 --> 00:03:03,005
Shizuka...

62
00:03:06,317 --> 00:03:07,785
She's there.

63
00:03:07,818 --> 00:03:11,914
Hey, Shizuka.

64
00:03:11,956 --> 00:03:14,015
Nobita.

65
00:03:14,058 --> 00:03:16,356
Shizuka, are you all right?

66
00:03:16,394 --> 00:03:18,260
Why did you come here?

67
00:03:18,295 --> 00:03:20,787
I came here for you. Don't worry.

68
00:03:20,831 --> 00:03:22,822
Leave the bag to me.

69
00:03:22,867 --> 00:03:24,357
No, I can't.

70
00:03:24,402 --> 00:03:26,837
Don't worry. Give it to me.

71
00:03:29,907 --> 00:03:32,433
I can handle it by myself.

72
00:03:34,011 --> 00:03:36,708
Don't walk around after you suffered the blizzard.

73
00:03:36,747 --> 00:03:38,977
You should confirm the direction by the map.

74
00:03:42,953 --> 00:03:45,354
You brought the map, right?

75
00:03:45,389 --> 00:03:47,517
That's your true self.

76
00:03:49,627 --> 00:03:52,927
We can rely on the Polaris to identify the direction. Don't worry.

77
00:03:52,963 --> 00:03:54,954
Great.

78
00:03:54,999 --> 00:03:58,230
It's a cave there. Let's go in to have a rest.

79
00:03:58,269 --> 00:03:59,828
Okay.

80
00:04:02,573 --> 00:04:06,669
The most terrible thing to the guy who suffered blizzard is the cold weather.

81
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:09,509
Let's make a fire to warm ourselves.

82
00:04:09,547 --> 00:04:11,777
I'll be in charge of making the fire.

83
00:04:15,486 --> 00:04:17,818
Jeez. I can't make it.

84
00:04:18,989 --> 00:04:21,583
I've got a lighter, you wanna try it.

85
00:04:21,625 --> 00:04:24,356
You've got a lighter? Of course.

86
00:04:24,395 --> 00:04:27,695
Because you're working hard, so I don't want to bother you.

87
00:04:29,433 --> 00:04:31,697
It's so cold.

88
00:04:31,735 --> 00:04:35,399
Put on this cloth. Don't worry about me.

89
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:36,998
It's so cold.

90
00:04:37,041 --> 00:04:40,773
This cloth is wet.

91
00:04:40,811 --> 00:04:44,111
How could you wear these clothes to the jokul?

92
00:04:44,148 --> 00:04:46,640
You clothes have become wet. Take off them.

93
00:04:46,684 --> 00:04:47,913
But...

94
00:04:47,952 --> 00:04:49,852
You'll die if you don't take off them.

95
00:04:49,887 --> 00:04:52,219
But I don't have other clothes.

96
00:04:52,256 --> 00:04:53,849
I'll give you my blanket.

97
00:04:53,891 --> 00:04:55,655
Thanks.

98
00:05:00,531 --> 00:05:02,932
I've brought lots of food to eat.

99
00:05:02,967 --> 00:05:04,799
Really? Great.

100
00:05:04,835 --> 00:05:10,933
You brought so many cans, but you forget to bring the can opener, right?

101
00:05:10,975 --> 00:05:12,875
Yeah, you're right.

102
00:05:15,746 --> 00:05:19,114
I've got some solid food. Eat it.

103
00:05:24,355 --> 00:05:26,722
I think he must be exhausted now.

104
00:05:31,862 --> 00:05:35,890
Be careful. It's a slippery ground here.

105
00:05:38,502 --> 00:05:41,767
I broke my leg. And I lost my glasses.

106
00:05:41,805 --> 00:05:43,500
I can't walk any more.

107
00:05:43,541 --> 00:05:45,771
I've asked for the succor.

108
00:05:45,809 --> 00:05:48,278
They'll be here soon. Cheer up.

109
00:05:50,481 --> 00:05:51,778
How is it going?

110
00:05:51,815 --> 00:05:55,649
Oh, no. It's all over.

111
00:05:55,686 --> 00:05:57,620
How can it be?

112
00:05:57,655 --> 00:06:00,022
I don't want to watch it any more.

113
00:06:00,057 --> 00:06:02,617
I'd like to marry Nobita.

114
00:06:03,627 --> 00:06:06,062
Thank you.

115
00:06:06,096 --> 00:06:09,930
If I don't stay with you, I'll worry about you.

116
00:06:09,967 --> 00:06:12,868
I don't want to be a trashy guy.

117
00:06:12,903 --> 00:06:17,397
So you should make a man of yourself.

